.git
.github
.playwright-mcp
node_modules
# The widget sub-project's own node_modules/src (~86MB) are not matched by
# the bare `node_modules` line above (Docker ignore patterns are relative-
# path matches, not recursive globs). The Dockerfile only COPYs the
# committed widgets/ output at repo root, never anything under web/, so
# it's safe to exclude the whole tree from the build context.
web/
*.md
